You wear a vest (20 lb / 14 lb) and complete as many rounds as you can in 20 minutes of 1 rope climb to 15 ft, 5 burpees and a 200 m run. Each round is short, so the score comes down to moving without stopping. The vest makes every rope climb heavier, so good foot technique saves your arms for the later rounds.',
   '[{"name": "Rope Climbs", "reps": "1 to 15 ft", "tip": "Lock the rope with your feet and stand up. Climb down under control.", "rx_men": "20 lb vest", "rx_women": "14 lb vest"}, {"name": "Burpees", "reps": "5", "tip": "Chest to the floor and a small jump at the top.", "rx_men": "20 lb vest", "rx_women": "14 lb vest"}, {"name": "Run", "reps": "200 m", "tip": "Run at a pace you can hold for 20 minutes.", "rx_men": "20 lb vest", "rx_women": "14 lb vest"}]'::jsonb,
   'Score is total rounds + reps.',
