   'Lower the thrusters to 95 lb / 65 lb or less, and swap chest-to-bar pull-ups for regular pull-ups or ring rows. Cut everything in half: 50 thrusters, 50 pull-ups and a 3 mile run. Walk parts of the run if needed.',
