You do sets of 30, 25, 20, 15, 10 and 5 of GHD sit-ups, back extensions, knees-to-elbows and stiff-legged deadlifts (95 lb / 65 lb). That is 105 reps of each movement, or 420 reps in all. Almost every rep works your trunk from the front or the back, so the challenge is keeping good positions as your midline tires. The big early sets go slowly, and the descending ladder brings you home.',
   '[{"name": "GHD Sit-Ups", "reps": "30-25-20-15-10-5", "tip": "Sit back until your hands reach toward the floor, then use your hips and legs to snap up."}, {"name": "Back Extensions", "reps": "30-25-20-15-10-5", "tip": "On the GHD, hinge at the hips with a flat back and rise until your body is straight."}, {"name": "Knees-to-Elbows", "reps": "30-25-20-15-10-5", "tip": "Hang from the bar and drive your knees up to touch your elbows."}, {"name": "Stiff-Legged Deadlifts", "reps": "30-25-20-15-10-5", "tip": "Keep your knees nearly straight, push your hips back, and lower the bar along your legs with a flat back.", "rx_men": "95 lb", "rx_women": "65 lb"}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
   '["Go easy on the first set of 30 GHD sit-ups", "Keep a flat back on every deadlift", "Break the knees-to-elbows early"]'::jsonb,
   '["If you are new to the GHD, do a few practice reps on another day first, because 105 sit-ups is a lot of volume.", "Keep your GHD sit-ups smooth rather than throwing your head back hard.", "On back extensions, stop when your body is straight and do not arch past it.", "Lower the stiff-legged deadlift only as far as your back stays flat, then stand tall.", "Plan quick sets of 5 to 10 knees-to-elbows to save your grip."]'::jsonb,
   'Replace GHD sit-ups with AbMat sit-ups and back extensions with good mornings or hip extensions on a bench. Swap knees-to-elbows for hanging knee raises. Lower the deadlift to 65 lb / 45 lb, or start the ladder at 20 instead of 30.',
   '[{"question": "What is the Stephen workout?", "answer": "30-25-20-15-10-5 reps of GHD sit-ups, back extensions, knees-to-elbows and stiff-legged deadlifts (95 lb / 65 lb), for time."}, {"question": "How many total reps are in Stephen?", "answer": "420 reps: 105 each of GHD sit-ups, back extensions, knees-to-elbows and stiff-legged deadlifts."}, {"question": "What if I do not have a GHD?", "answer": "Do AbMat sit-ups and good mornings or hip extensions instead, and note the change with your time."}, {"question": "Who was Stephen?", "answer": "Cpl. Stephen Bouzane, 26, of the Third Battalion, Princess Patricia''s Canadian Light Infantry. He was killed by an improvised explosive device on June 20, 2007, in the Panjwaii District of Afghanistan."}]'::jsonb,
