   'Swift 1-1 honors the five Marines killed on June 8, 2022, when their MV-22 Osprey, call sign Swift 1-1, crashed during formation flying and aerial gunnery practice over a desert range near El Centro, California: Capt. Nicholas P. Losapio, 31; Capt. John J. Sax, 33; Cpl. Nathan E. Carlson, 21; Cpl. Seth D. Rasmuson, 21; and Lance Cpl. Evan A. Strickland, 19. Investigators found a fatal engine failure caused the crash.

You do 5 rounds of a 31-calorie bike, 33 dumbbell lunges, 21 toes-to-bars, 21 push-ups and 19 alternating dumbbell snatches, with one dumbbell (50 lb / 35 lb). Each round is long, and the lunges and snatches keep your legs and grip busy right after the bike.',
   '[{"name": "Air Bike", "reps": "31 cal", "tip": "Push and pull with both arms and legs. Hold a pace you can repeat 5 times."}, {"name": "Dumbbell Lunges", "reps": "33", "tip": "Hold the dumbbell in any position you like. Back knee kisses the floor and you stand tall each rep.", "rx_men": "50 lb", "rx_women": "35 lb"}, {"name": "Toes-to-Bar", "reps": "21", "tip": "Hang from the bar and swing your toes up to touch it between your hands."}, {"name": "Push-Ups", "reps": "21", "tip": "Chest to the floor and lock your arms at the top."}, {"name": "Alternating Dumbbell Snatches", "reps": "19", "tip": "Swap hands each rep and lock the dumbbell overhead.", "rx_men": "50 lb", "rx_women": "35 lb"}]'::jsonb,
   'Record your finish time.',
